+# Architecture
+
+- `src/router.ts`: a tiny router with middleware; no framework.
+- `src/routes/`: one file per resource. Each `register*Routes` function adds its handlers.
+- `src/auth.ts`: bearer tokens are `<userId>.<hmac>` signed with `AUTH_SECRET`.
+- `migrations/`: plain SQL strings with `up` and `down`, run in file-name order.
+
+Adding an endpoint: write the handler in `src/routes/`, then a test in `test/routes/`.
